  id: wfo_we_mid_21
  displayName: 
  description: I'll ask you honestly, are these things you do, the money you earn,
    more important than a peaceful life with me? Come, let's prepare ourselves for
    the life we'll embark on together. Let's disappear from here for a month. Let's
    just dedicate time to ourselves, to us...
